<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ share market closed for ANZAC Day holiday.</title>
<headline>NZ share market closed for ANZAC Day holiday.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand share market was closed on Friday for the ANZAC Day national holiday.</p>
<p>The top 40 index closed 0.97 points weaker on Thursday at 2253.57.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
